01:25:59,648 --> 01:26:06,833
Vましょうか = Shall I V? / '電話(でんわ)をかける' = to make a phone call

1347
01:26:06,856 --> 01:26:09,956
Listening Test

1348
01:26:09,956 --> 01:26:13,532
Yes, please do.

1349
01:26:18,507 --> 01:26:21,883
Listening Test

1350
01:26:21,883 --> 01:26:25,849
What’s the phone number?

1351
01:26:25,849 --> 01:26:31,316
何番(なんばん)ですか = What number is it? / '電話番号(でんわばんごう)' = phone number

1352
01:26:31,339 --> 01:26:38,111
Listening Test

1353
01:26:38,111 --> 01:26:46,344
It’s 090-1234-5678.

1354
01:26:57,476 --> 01:27:00,376
Listening Test

1355
01:27:00,376 --> 01:27:03,719
Okay, calling now.

1356
01:27:08,375 --> 01:27:12,409
Listening Test

1357
01:27:12,409 --> 01:27:17,199
Oh, I hear the sound!

1358
01:27:17,199 --> 01:27:23,748
N + が聞(き)こえます = Can hear N / N is audible / '音(おと)' = sound

1359
01:27:23,771 --> 01:27:26,638
Listening Test

1360
01:27:26,638 --> 01:27:29,957
Where’s it coming from?

1361
01:27:29,957 --> 01:27:34,543
どこから = From where / '聞(き)こえる' = can be heard

1362
01:27:34,566 --> 01:27:37,799
Listening Test

1363
01:27:37,799 --> 01:27:41,552
From that sofa over there.

1364
01:27:41,552 --> 01:27:46,719
からです = It's because... / It comes from...

1365
01:27:46,742 --> 01:27:49,575
Listening Test

1366
01:27:49,575 --> 01:27:52,842
Under the sofa?

1367
01:27:52,842 --> 01:27:57,355
N + ですか = Is it N?

1368
01:27:57,378 --> 01:28:02,245
Listening Test

1369
01:28:02,245 --> 01:28:08,042
No, behind the sofa cushion.

1370
01:28:08,042 --> 01:28:15,942
N1 + の + N2 = N2 of N1 / '前(まえ)' (front) ↔ '後(うし)ろ' (back or behind)

1371
01:28:15,965 --> 01:28:19,279
Listening Test

1372
01:28:19,279 --> 01:28:23,179
Oh, found it!

1373
01:28:23,179 --> 01:28:28,524
Vました + よ = I V-ed (just so you know) / '見(み)つかる' = to be found

1374
01:28:28,547 --> 01:28:30,880
Listening Test

1375
01:28:30,880 --> 01:28:33,547
Really?

1376
01:28:33,547 --> 01:28:37,224
本当(ほんとう) = Truth / Reality

1377
01:28:37,248 --> 01:28:39,514
Listening Test

1378
01:28:39,514 --> 01:28:42,052
Great!

1379
01:28:42,052 --> 01:28:45,590
良(よ)かったです = That's great! / I'm so glad!

1380
01:28:45,614 --> 01:28:48,681
Listening Test

1381
01:28:48,681 --> 01:28:52,226
Yes, here it is.

1382
01:28:52,226 --> 01:28:57,126
これです = This is it / Here it is

1383
01:28:57,149 --> 01:28:59,297
Listening Test

1384
01:28:59,297 --> 01:29:01,730
Thank you.

1385
01:29:05,135 --> 01:29:07,527
Listening Test

1386
01:29:07,527 --> 01:29:10,243
What a relief!

1387
01:29:10,243 --> 01:29:14,027
安心(あんしん)する = To feel relieved / To be at ease

1388
01:29:14,050 --> 01:29:17,590
Listening Test

1389
01:29:17,590 --> 01:29:21,733
Please be more careful from now on.

1390
01:29:21,733 --> 01:29:27,433
Vてください = Please V / '気(き)をつける' = to be careful or pay attention